{"id":"ef9317bf30494788eef9bf4ed0ad4464eb180b0d","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1239618","title":"GPT-6 Astra Ultra 消耗有点大","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"kkwa56188","excerpt":"OpenAI - @kkwa56188 - 今天发现可以用 GPT-6 Astra 了, 让它操作我的一个在线的 google spreadsheet 表格按以往的 pattern 预测未来一年的数据, 发送 prompt 的时候手多 拉到最","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>今天发现可以用 GPT-6 Astra 了, 让它操作我的一个在线的 google spreadsheet 表格按以往的 pattern 预测未来一年的数据,  发送 prompt 的时候手多 拉到最满选了 Ultra 级别, 最后跑了十分钟, 生成了百多行新数据, 数据质量看起来还可以. </p>\n<p>一看用量, 我是 plus 的周额度一下掉了 15%,  要这么跑的话 一个小时就能烧掉我一周的额度</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18052382\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3df9/57ba/69588_normal.png?m=1661906159\" alt=\"YAFEIML\" data-uid=\"69588\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/YAFEIML\">YAFEIML</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-05 08:52:04 +08:00\">15h 7m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>同样的活，你雇两个人干，一个吭哧吭哧干了五天收你 500 ，一个吭哧吭哧干了半天收你 500 ，谁亏了谁赚了？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18052399\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e72f/93ee/237505_normal.png?m=1785372754\" alt=\"licoycn\" data-uid=\"237505\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/licoycn\">licoycn</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-05 09:05:56 +08:00\">14h 53m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不用怕，直接开 pro 20x ，使劲蹬 😁</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18052426\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/57b94f7f153f3745286c0b8db7131786?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"layxy\" data-uid=\"428568\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/layxy\">layxy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-05 09:19:10 +08:00\">14h 40m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>Ultra 都不是一般人能用的，你就是 pro20x 使用 sol Ultra 额度也是蹭蹭的往下掉</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18052454\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5fb3/89b0/104347_normal.png?m=1785485207\" alt=\"hellodigua\" data-uid=\"104347\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/hellodigua\">hellodigua</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-05 09:32:33 +08:00\">14h 27m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>20x 也不敢用 ultra ，开的 xhigh ，结果一轮就消耗 4%，感觉一天就能用完🤣</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18052516\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/827e02b2e57bef549d57febc049c0bf7?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"lichv7\" data-uid=\"596481\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lichv7\">lichv7</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#